2 CONT * Carl XVI Gustaf, Kung av Sverige is Adolf Fredrik Munck af Fulkila's 9th cousin five times removed! [http://www.geni.com/path/Adolf+Fredrik+Munck+af+Fulkila+is+related+to+Carl+XVI+Gustaf+Kung+av+Sverige?from=6000000003748326674&
2 CONC to=4111915 länk]
