1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Tillhörde 1804 Franska Reformerta Församlingen i Stockholm.
2 CONT -------------
2 CONT Greta Sjoberg & Axel Georg Laurent
2 CONT Avioliitto:	2. marraskuuta 1804  Adolf Fredriks Forsamling, Stockholm, Stockholm, Sweden
2 CONT
2 CONT Olafbina Ulrika Smedberg & Axel Georg Laurent
2 CONT Avioliitto	7. lokakuuta 1821  Solna, Stockholm, Sweden
2 CONT Olafbina Ulrika Smedberg synt. 1798, ikä 23 vuotta
2 CONT Axel Georg Laurent '''synt. 1771, ikä 50 vuotta'''
2 CONT -------------
2 CONT The first wife of Axel Laurent was Margaretha Helena Sjöberg, who died 9 March 1818. She was 35 years old and they lived in Klara.
2 CONT
2 CONT The manufacturist from Stockholm, Herr Axel Georg Laurent, married Mamsell Olofina Ulrika Smedberg from Stenbrottet 7 October 1821. He presented his attestation from Pastor du Fernex in the French Reformed Church. She had consent 
2 CONC from her warden, her brother, the actor H. Smedberg.Their daughter Henrica Amalia was born and baptized less than a month later, 1 November 1821.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1823 Axel Laurent lived in the quarter Apeln in Klara parish with his (second) wife Olofina Ulrika and three children (from his first marriage). '''His birth date is given as 23 March 1776'''.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1829 The family moved from Maria parish to Hedvig Eleonora.
2 CONT
2 CONT The stocking manufacturer Axel Georg Laurent died 13 December 1835 at an age of 60 years. He left the widow Olofina Ulrica Smedberg and five children. From his first marriage: Sophia Wilhelmina Laurent born 17 December 1819 and Ca
2 CONC rl Axel Laurent, born 12 February 1820. From his second marriage: Alexina Pandora Laurent, born 12 April 1823, Adolfina Oscara Laurent, born 3 July 1825 and Georg Bernadotte Laurent, born 3 July 1831.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Laurent-516 
2 CONT
