2 CONT
2 CONT Lagman/lappfogde/köpman. Had seven children (1530-1545, the year of birth uncertain for the first four) with his Kelug, Margareta Grubb (-> Ångerman) being the second born, appr. 1530.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Talollinen, Ångermanlandin ja Umeån lapinvouti vuodesta 1553 sekä maakauppias, mainitaan Umeån Grubbessa 1543-65.
