1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Barbara Magdalena Ehrenhjelm/Ehrenhielm=
2 CONT
2 CONT '''She went by Magdalena Ehrenhjelm'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * Daughter of Johan Salonius Svensson Ehrenhielm and Magdalena Eriksdotter Gyldenbring
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Ehrenhielm_nr_846 Noble House Ehrenhielm No. 846, by Adelsvapen Genealogies]
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Johan Salonius , knighted Ehrenhielm,''' to Berga and Näringsberg, both in Västerhaninge parish, Stockholm County. Born (G. Westerin, Västerhaninge and Muskö parishes (1897).) 1639-06-08 in Uppsala. Student there in 1648 (Ach.)
2 CONC . Curator in Uppland's nation 1662–1663 (Ach.). Disputant 1663 (Ach.). Secretary in Svea Court of Appeal 1672-02-29. Knighted 1673-05-13 (introduced in 1675 under no. 846). District chief in Sollentuna, Bro and Närdinghundra distr
2 CONC icts in Uppland 1674-12-19. Audit secretary 1689-09-30. Died 1697-08-20 in Stockholm and is buried with his wife in Västerhaninge church. '''Married to his step-sister's daughter Magdalena Gyldenbring ,''' died 1717-03-20, daughte
2 CONC r of the assessor Erik Bring, ennobled Gyldenbring , and Catharina Edenberg .
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children=
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Sven,''' born 1673, died young.
2 CONT * '''Anna Catharina,''' born 1674, died 1749-04-23. Married to Court of Appeals Councilor Johan Fredrik Flach , naturalized Flach, no. 1606, in his 2nd marriage, born 1657, died 1734.
2 CONT * '''Barbara Magdalena,'''  born 1677, died 1727-09-29 at Lindenäs in Motala parish, Östergötland county. Married 1703-08-00 to her aunt's stepson, the assessor Harald Appelbom , born 1669, died 1730.
2 CONT * '''Aleta Elisabet,''' born 1679, died 1749-04-00 in Stockholm. Married 1703-09-13 to professor Erik Castovius in Uppsala, born 1655 in Karlstorps parish, Jönköping county, died 1703-12-04 in Uppsala.
2 CONT * '''Erik,''' born 1680. Assessor. Died 1731. See Tab. 2.
2 CONT * '''Johanna Margareta,''' born 1681-09-07, died 1757-09-29 Hårmesta and buried in Biskopskulla church, but then taken to Uppsala to be buried in Uppsala. Married 1720-01-07 Lindhov to his sister's brother-in-law, the professor in
2 CONC  Uppsala Gabriel Peter Castovius .
2 CONT * '''Johan,''' born 1684 in Stockholm. Student in Uppsala 1689-06-13. Died (G. Westerin, Västerhaninge and Muskö parishes (1897).) 1695-11-17 in Stockholm and buried in Västerhaninge church.
2 CONT * '''Gertrud Christina,''' born 1689, died unmarried 17-06-1743 in Berga.
2 CONT * '''Maria,''' born 1691, died unmarried.
2 CONT * '''Johan,'''  born 1695, died 1705.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =Sources=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Gustaf Elgenstierna , The introduced genealogical tables of the Swedish nobility. 1925-36.
2 CONT
