2 CONT Johan (son of Erik, Tab. 2), born 1712-11-26 in Stockholm. Student in Uppsala 1726-10-24. Auscultant in Svea Court of Appeal 1732-05-26. Clerk in the Attorney-General's Office 1733-07-03. Extraordinary ordinary notary in the Attor
2 CONC ney-General's Office 1735-09-00. Deputy notary 1740-04-23. Clerk 1744-05-02 notary 1745-06-18. County Governor within Roslagen 1753-07-26. Died 1755-03-16 Hårmesta and buried in Biskopskulla Church, where his coat of arms was erec
2 CONC ted. '''Married 1740-01-23, to his cousin Anna Charlotta Appelbom , born 1710-07-03 in Örebro, died 1763-07-04 Sjöberg, daughter of assessor Harald Appelbom , and Barbara Magdalena Ehrenhielm.'''
